            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Privacy and security fixes. Nothing changes in how you use Ochre.

- Feedback is sent a safer way. It still reaches me the same as before.
- Fetching a link's title, picture and icon no longer keeps cookies from those sites, so they can't follow you from one saved link to the next.
- Importing an Ochre library only reads files inside it.
- Previews of your notes don't stay behind after you delete them.
]]></description>
